        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beardstown%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "French explorers named the site “Beautiful Mound Village” because of large Indian burial mounds at its base.",
